{"id":"e54b8122e9c15aa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-rank.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Name Rank","display":"df-zfc-forcing-name-rank — ZFC Forcing Name Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-name-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-name-rank","58-df-zfc-forcing12-name-rank","58-df-zfc-forcing2-name-rank","58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-rank","58-df-zfc-forcing8-name-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-name-rank — ZFC Forcing Name Rank","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-name-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-name-rank</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-name-rank</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing2-name-rank</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-rank</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-name-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-name-rank — ZFC Forcing Name Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(\\rho,\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha^{\\mathbb P}\">\\(V_\\alpha^{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> denotes the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-th level of the ranked name hierarchy from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2NameRank}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2NameRank}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12NameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8NameRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12NameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameRank}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8NameRank}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\\land\n\\tau\\subseteq V_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\rho\\;\\neg\\bigl(\\tau\\subseteq V_\\beta^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\\land\n\\tau\\subseteq V_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\rho\\;\\neg\\bigl(\\tau\\subseteq V_\\beta^{\\mathbb P}\\times\\mathbb P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12NameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12NameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2NameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2NameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\rho,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameRank}_S(\\tau,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameRank}_S(\\tau,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8NameRank}_S(\\tau,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8NameRank}_S(\\tau,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameRank}_S(\\alpha,\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rank is the least ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> whose stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\">\\(V_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> contains every predecessor name.  These are the actual symbols defined by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a>; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\mathcal N_\\rho^{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> hierarchy was nonexistent.</li>\n<li>Numbered name-rank variants are merged here; they differ only by argument order or an unused ambient forcing parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hy